  Data:
  - Dialogue: I am speaking to you through this simulation.
    Name: <b>D.V.I.S.E.R</b>
    WaitForAction: 0
    DialogueNext: 0
  - Dialogue: You need to learn this now to prevent waste of resources. I only have
      a finite amount.
    Name: <b>D.V.I.S.E.R</b>
    WaitForAction: 0
    DialogueNext: 0
  - Dialogue: We must act quickly as my own power reserves deplete.
    Name: <b>D.V.I.S.E.R</b>
    WaitForAction: 0
    DialogueNext: 0
  - Dialogue: Insert some cool ah explination. {Input=Jump}
    Name: <b>D.V.I.S.E.R</b>
    WaitForAction: 0
    DialogueNext: 0
  - Dialogue: Insert some cool ah explination AGAIN!. {Input=Jump}
    Name: <b>D.V.I.S.E.R</b>
    WaitForAction: 0
